                <pb facs="0554" n="472" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg472"/>

                <head>[Inclosure—Translation.]</head>
                <p>On account of attack of last Sunday on train from Mexico City to Cuernavaca most
                    alarming reports have been circulated regarding situation at Cuernavaca, where
                    there are many American residents. Communication between Cuernavaca and Mexico
                    City has been reestablished, and I have official reports to the effect that the
                    situation at Cuernavaca is not alarming and that all residents there are fully
                    protected.</p>
            </div>
